X: 1
T: Mushnik and Son
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: Mushnik's offer song from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 1) of a
N: hamienet.com MIDI (id 7940), octave as in the source; chords fitted from the
N: accompaniment (the chromatic cliche Cm-Db7-Dm7 under the name-chant). The
N: pushing syncopations are straightened to half-bar notes; pitches are the
N: source's. Scope: the "Mushnik and Son" chant with its chromatic climb and the
N: answer phrase (source bars 33-40, 47-48).
